<title>NEW ZEALAND: Port of Tauranga lifts first half profit.</title>
<headline>Port of Tauranga lifts first half profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    5.28 vs 4.42</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    6.9 vs 5.8</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    3.5 vs 2.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				21.6 vs 19.8</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  8.2 vs 6.8</p>
<p>    Tax					2.9 vs 2.4</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date March 27</p>
<p>Reg date March 14</p>
<p>    Ex div   March 17</p>
<p>Note - Port of Tauranga operates the Tauranga port.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
